    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Voice Room - Permanent Room】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Access: </><Assistant_System>Play Voice Room - Settings (Bottom Right) - Permanent Button (Top Right)</>{JumpToUI:[【前往查看】]|1250316}\n<Assistant_Title2>Permanent Item: </>You can purchase a Permanent Contract in the <Assistant_System>Mall - Secret Collection</>. Using it converts a Play Voice Room into a permanent room and adds 30 days of permanent duration. A single item can extend the duration by 30 days, with a maximum cumulative extension of 90 days.\n<Assistant_Title2>Function Introduction: </>After converting to a permanent room, the voice room will be retained even after you <Assistant_Red>exit the permanent voice room or go offline</>, and the host will retain their host status.<Assistant_Red>Permanent voice rooms cannot have their host status transferred.</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quantity Limit: </>Each character can own a maximum of <Assistant_Red>1 permanent voice room</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Disbanding the Room: </>A permanent voice room can be disbanded by the host; once disbanded, it <Assistant_Red>cannot be recovered</>;\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[语音房-房主权限]|1395}, {SendAnswer:[语音房-普通语音房]|1396}, {SendAnswer:[语音房-玩法语音房]|1397}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Voice Room - Permanent Room】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Access: </><Assistant_System>Play Voice Room - Settings (Bottom Right) - Permanent Button (Top Right)</>{JumpToUI:[【Go to View】]|1250316}\n<Assistant_Title2>Permanent Item: </>You can purchase a Permanent Contract in the <Assistant_System>Mall - Secret Collection</>. Using it converts a Play Voice Room into a permanent room and adds 30 days of permanent duration. A single item can extend the duration by 30 days, with a maximum cumulative extension of 90 days.\n<Assistant_Title2>Function Introduction: </>After converting to a permanent room, the voice room will be retained even after you <Assistant_Red>exit the permanent voice room or go offline</>, and the host will retain their host status.<Assistant_Red>Permanent voice rooms cannot have their host status transferred.</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quantity Limit: </>Each character can own a maximum of <Assistant_Red>1 permanent voice room</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Disbanding the Room: </>A permanent voice room can be disbanded by the host; once disbanded, it <Assistant_Red>cannot be recovered</>;\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Voice Room-Host Permissions]|1395}, {SendAnswer:[Voice Room-Standard Voice Room]|1396}, {SendAnswer:[Voice Room-Play Voice Room]|1397}",
